ds, dry bulk traders, and shipping and logistics companies. As of 31 December 2025, its fleet consists of 36 controlled vessels and 12 vessels through joint ventures, including 9 bulk carriers, 17 oil/chemical tankers, and 2 crew transport vessels with a combined weight carrying capacity of 1.70 million dwt. Seacon Shipping Group Holdings Limited was founded in 2012 and is headquartered in Qingdao, the People's Republic of China.","description_en":"Seacon Shipping Group Holdings Limited, an investment holding company, provides integrated shipping services in the People's Republic of China. The company operates in two segments, Shipping Business and Ship Management Business. It offers shipping services for commodity owners, traders, and shipping service companies through its controlled or chartered-in vessels, which transport dry bulks, bunkers, and petrochemical products. The company also provides ship management and value-added services, such as technical management, crew manning, business services, commercial support, marine insurance arrangements, shipbuilding supervision, and sale and purchase support of vessels and insurance to ship owners, finance leasing companies, shipyards, dry bulk traders, and shipping and logistics companies. As of 31 December 2025, its fleet consists of 36 controlled vessels and 12 vessels through joint ventures, including 9 bulk carriers, 17 oil/chemical tankers, and 2 crew transport vessels with a combined weight carrying capacity of 1.70 million dwt. Seacon Shipping Group Holdings Limited was founded in 2012 and is headquartered in Qingdao, the People's Republic of China.","description_zh":null,"address":"29F, Zone B, Yinfeng Fortune Plaza","city":"Qingdao","state":"SD","zip":"266101","country":"CN","phone":null,"full_address":"29F, Zone B, Yinfeng Fortune Plaza, Qingdao, SD, 266101, CN","year_high":7.37,"year_low":3.5,"range_52w":"3.5-7.37","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":nu